Data licence
============

Datasets distributed with this package, and datasets produced by its
generator, are derived from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org/), which is
made available under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
licence (CC BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

This licence covers the data only. The code in this repository is under a
separate licence; see the LICENSE file. A user of this package takes on the
obligations of both.

CC BY 4.0 requires that attribution reaches the people who use an application
built with this package, not only the readers of this repository. The package
therefore exposes the required attribution text programmatically, through
`ReverseGeocoder.attribution`, so that an application can display it, for
example on a licences screen. Every dataset the generator produces carries
that text with it.
